(text "SIDEEYE / SERVO + ToF WIRING" (at 43.18 22.86 0) (effects (font (size 2.54 2.54)) (justify left top)) (uuid "56575d8f-21ac-4346-8752-9853f7ebcec5"))
(text "CONTROLLER: USB POWER" (at 111.76 50.8 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left top)) (uuid "c1c7d1dd-9f36-4aa8-8eec-cea67c3c9e10"))
(text "WIRING NOTES" (at 43.18 137.16 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left top)) (uuid "a92943ee-4f29-4464-bbff-ec0a8bd662b1"))
(text "1. U1 is a XIAO ESP32-S3 host; Grove Vision AI V2 uses a separate Himax HX6538.\n2. REQUIRED: selective adapter / separate wiring. Connect only M1 pins 5, 6, 13, 14 to XIAO.\n   Do not fully stack the 14-pin socket: isolate all other contacts, including M1 pin 12 (3V3).\n   D0/D1/D6/D7 go ONLY to servos / LPn; Grove D3 is RESET, D8 is SD/SPI clock.\n3. Power XIAO by USB; its VBUS feeds Grove M1 pin 14. J5 powers servos; allow for stall current.\n   All GNDs common. Servo +5V stays separate from logic power. Check USB supply capacity.\n4. D4/D5 share I2C between Grove and both ToF boards; use 3.3 V pullups, account for all parallel pullups.\n   Use the Grove XIAO socket SDA/SCL (3.3 V), not its separate Grove 4-pin port. Bus: 400 kHz maximum.\n5. D6/D7 control sensor LPn separately. Enable one sensor at a time and assign unique addresses.\n   Example 7-bit addresses: ToF 0x29 / 0x2A, Grove 0x62. ST driver may use shifted 8-bit addresses.\n6. J1-J4 are functional interfaces: match labels to your breakout. Use 3.3 V-compatible ToF boards.\n   I2C_RST low; INT unused (polling). Check XIAO 3V3 budget for both boards; PWM is 3.3 V logic." (at 43.18 142.24 0) (effects (font (size 1.016 1.016)) (justify left top)) (uuid "30896ecd-4a75-4605-9a22-274def4558c9"))
(text "D0 / GPIO1 = servo 1 PWM\nD1 / GPIO2 = servo 2 PWM\nD4 / GPIO5 = SDA (shared)\nD5 / GPIO6 = SCL (shared)\nD6 / GPIO43 = sensor 1 LPn\nD7 / GPIO44 = sensor 2 LPn" (at 195.58 116.84 0) (effects (font (size 1.016 1.016)) (justify left top)) (uuid "350a70c6-350c-4a48-a4a9-76d273365678"))
(symbol (lib_id "SideEye_Wiring:Grove_Vision_AI_V2_I2C") (at 142.24 27.94 0) (unit 1) (in_bom yes) (on_board no) (dnp no) (uuid "3d241503-8a43-4725-a9e7-4111a08b260f") (property "Reference" "J6" (at 163.83 22.86 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))) (property "Value" "GROVE VISION AI V2 / I2C" (at 163.83 25.4 0) (effects (font (size 1.016 1.016)))) (instances (project "sideeye" (path "/f5c2a4d7-5a15-4583-b1e5-94f0d73ba681" (reference "J6") (unit 1)))))
